␀␀␀␀hasRef␀␀seen␀␀␀␀diff␀␀␀␀events␀␀colourPct␀␀␀#%02x%02x%02x␀␀␀rgb␀activeMs␀␀␀␀stillMs␀expected {"regions": [...]}␀eight areas at most␀every area needs a name␀the name "%.30s" is too long: 23 characters at most␀"%s" needs x, y, w and h, as parts of the screen (0..1)␀"%s" is too small: at least half a percent of the screen each way␀␀␀"%s": mode is change, still, like, unlike or colour␀"%s": colour is any, black, grey, white, red, orange, yellow, green, cyan, blue or magenta␀␀two areas are called "%s"␀␀␀could not save: %s␀␀"%s" turned %s.␀"%s" is %s.␀The picture in "%s" changed.␀␀␀␀"%s" has stopped changing.␀␀"%s" looks like the picture it remembers.␀␀␀"%s" no longer looks like the picture it remembers.␀not probed yet␀␀not built into this firmware␀␀␀␀kvm_caps␀␀␀␀W (%lu) %s: %s probed but not compiled in
